1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Sorteio Pro is a web app for Instagram professional accounts
to run transparent giveaways based on comments on their own posts.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The interface is in English (EN/PT switch in the top bar).

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The user clicks "Log in with Instagram" to start the Meta login flow.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Instagram Login: the user signs in
with their Instagram professional account.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The user grants Sorteio Pro access to
instagram_business_basic and instagram_business_manage_comments.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
instagram_business_basic: we display the logged-in account's
username and profile to identify the user.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:02,000
instagram_business_basic: we list the user's own posts
(thumbnail, caption, comment count) so they can choose one for the giveaway.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The user selects the post whose comments will be used.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:24,000
instagram_business_manage_comments: we read the comments
(text, username, timestamp, replies) of the selected post.
Read-only: we never post, reply to, hide or delete comments.

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The user applies rules to the loaded comments: one entry per person,
required keyword, minimum mentions, excluded users.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
A random winner is drawn from the eligible comments.

12
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
A public certificate with a SHA-256 hash
lets participants verify the result.

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Users can view past giveaways and disconnect
or delete their account and data at any time.

14
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Privacy Policy and Data Deletion instructions are publicly available.
